# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values before running the application.

## Application

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
```

## Database (PostgreSQL via Prisma)

```
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/fundedexperts
```

## Authentication (JWT)

```
JWT_SECRET=change-me-in-production
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=7d
```

## MT5 Integration

```
MT5_API_URL=
MT5_API_KEY=
MT5_API_SECRET=
```

## Caching (Redis)

```
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
```

## Email (SMTP)

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SMTP_HOST=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SMTP_PORT=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SMTP_USER=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SMTP_PASSWORD=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SMTP_FROM=
```
